  "benefits_features_and_faqs": {
    "about_overview": "YES First Business Credit Card is a business-oriented credit card that is specifically designed for self-employed professionals. This card offers up to 16 reward points for every Rs. 200 spent on multiple categories and 4 reward points per Rs. 200 on select categories. Besides this, cardholders can also earn up to 5X reward points on select spends by opting for the Rewards Subscription Plan at an annual fee of up to Rs. 5,000. For frequent travellers, this card offers 8 complimentary domestic & 6 international lounge visits per year. It also charges a low forex markup fee of 1.75%, enhancing its overall value for overseas travellers. The card not only offers travel benefits but also comes with lifestyle benefits like free golf lessons, and milestone benefits of up to 20,000 reward points and more. Overall, this credit card is a decent choice for business owners looking to maximize their savings on everyday spends while availing decent travel & lifestyle benefits.",
